  "statuteText": "664:9-b Reports of Receipts and Expenditures Filed Electronically. –\n\nA political committee or a candidate may file such candidate's report of receipts and expenditures, pursuant to RSA 664:6, RSA 664:7, and RSA 664:7-b, electronically online by using the New Hampshire campaign finance system, which may also be used to register and search information filed by candidates and political committees."
